Error [E0801]: tell me the type of `x`
  --> tests/ui/lambda_param_type_unknown.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     f :: (x) => x + 1
    |           ^
 Why: this lambda parameter has no type to go on
 Fix: write `(x: Int) => …` (or whatever type fits)

Error [E0116]: `f` doesn't hand back a value
  --> tests/ui/lambda_param_type_unknown.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(f(5))
    |           ^
 Why: only calls that declare `=> Type` can be used as a value
 Fix: call `f` on its own line, or give it a return type
